# DERIVED PIXELS, NOT EVIDENCE.
#
# A campaign's vision stages redraw every figure from raw frames that are
# already committed under recordings/vision_thesis/. Keeping a second copy
# per campaign would add ~240 MB per run to a history that is already 3.5 GB,
# and would add nothing: the numbers are in measurements.csv, data/ and the
# campaign's own campaign.json, and any figure is one --replay away.
#
# What IS kept: campaign.json, report.md, logs/, and every JSON and CSV a
# stage produced.
*/cv_replay/stages/
*/cv_replay/preview/
*/cv_replay/sheet_*.png
*/cv_replay/raw/
*/cv_selftest/**/stages/
*/cv_selftest/**/preview/
*/cv_selftest/**/sheet_*.png
